# Caches and assets never enter git; see CONVENTIONS.md §4.
# Run outputs are ignored except the v2 evidence below, which is committed so that a result can be traced:
#   runs/offline_v2/           exploratory offline report (legacy-pipeline data)
#   runs/v2_s1_*/              S1 smoke runs
#   runs/v2_s2_*/              S2 calibration and development runs
#   runs/v2_s4_*/              S4 frozen test runs
#   runs/v2_decisions/         frozen selector decisions
#   runs/image_evidence_check*.json
# Inside those directories everything is kept (answers, config, environment, log, prompt samples, scores,
# action tables) except lock files and per-shard answer files, which the merged <dataset>.jsonl repeats.
# GitHub rejects files over 100 MB: gzip a larger <dataset>.jsonl before committing it (*.jsonl.gz is kept).
runs/*
!runs/offline_v2/
!runs/v2_s1_*/
!runs/v2_s2_*/
!runs/v2_s4_*/
!runs/v2_decisions/
!runs/image_evidence_check*.json
runs/**/*.lock
runs/**/*.shard[0-9][0-9]-of-[0-9][0-9].jsonl
runs/**/*.tmp
cache/
assets/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
.DS_Store

# Official upstream repositories (scripts/fetch_external.py); pinned in third_party/external_repos.json
external/

# LaTeX build output of the paper (latexmk -pdf paper/main.tex)
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/*.fls
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/main.pdf

# Scratch directories of local review sessions
_review_tmp/
.claude/
